<!-- People › Reviews & goals (design-people §11, §1.2; impl-people P20): Reviews (the default: the user's review work, their own
    reviews, those they review and, for development, all of their employers'), Goals, Review cycles and Review forms (the review
    administrator's), with ReviewDetail and ReviewRelease out of the menu. Every People user opens the area through the root, and what
    each sees is what Mantle's ReviewServices admit: a person their own review and goals, a reviewer the reviews they are given, a
    feedback giver their own feedback, an approver the review they decide, development every review of its employers; a reviewer's
    private notes their author's alone. A self-service employee without the launcher opens the area by its own grant
    (BOSS_PPL_PERFORMANCE), for their own reviews, goals and feedback. Review cycles and Review forms are the review administrator's
    (BOSS_PPL_REVIEW_ADMIN: BOSS_PEOPLE_DEVELOP, the People administrator and ADMIN; denied to the root user group and self-service). -->
<screen xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xsi:noNamespaceSchemaLocation="http://moqui.org/xsd/xml-screen-3.xsd"
        default-menu-title="Reviews &amp; goals" default-menu-index="13" menu-image="sym_o_rate_review" menu-image-type="icon">
    <subscreens default-item="Reviews">
        <!-- Reviews (menu index 1), Goals (2), ReviewCycles (3) and ReviewForms (4) are files under Performance/, with ReviewDetail
            and ReviewRelease out of the menu -->
    </subscreens>
    <widgets>
        <subscreens-active/>
    </widgets>
</screen>
